commit e8b38813182986b07a65f2fc688288e2a64a1585

C03: the deictic-level clarification contract no longer says «nivel» (AUDIO1381)

AUDIO1379 measured the question check: «Ponlo a 100 ahora» asked what to set, but «devuelvelo a 100» and several variants exhausted both wordings with «¿A qué nivel…?» and fell to the generic recovery («No pude entender bien tu mensaje»). The situation text itself said «a un nivel (un número)» and the model echoed it.

llm.clarify_unresolved_input (deictic_level): the situation and the correction speak of a number already given and a missing thing, and show the asked shape as an example («¿Qué querés poner en 100: el volumen o el brillo?»). The model still composes the question; no fixed reply.

No .NET change. Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


